This directory is image-owned Xenoteer configuration.

Phase 0 keeps runtime values in the explicit s6 environment directory generated
at /run/xenoteer/env. Typed daemon values are stored as the exact value plus one
terminator newline and consumed with `s6-envdir -f -L`; this preserves empty,
embedded-newline, and trailing-newline values for the strict Rust loader. Future
immutable desktop profiles belong here; secrets and mutable session state do not.
